# Configuration

There are two way to config the sdk.

## Runtime configuration
Supported methods:

- set_endpoint(endpoint: String) -> Variant
- add_header(key: String, value: String) -> RefCounted
- set_self_signed(status: bool = true) -> RefCounted
{% for header in spec.global.headers %}
- set_{{header.key | caseSnake}}(value: String) -> RefCounted
{% endfor %}

### Example Usage

```gdscript
extends Node

func _ready():
    {{prefix}}.set_endpoint('<API Endpoint>')
    {{prefix}}.set_project('<Project ID>')
```

## Environment Variables
Copy the downloaded `.env.example` to `res://.env` and fill in the values.

Supported variables:

- {{ prefix | caseUpper }}_ENDPOINT
- {{ prefix | caseUpper }}_SELF_SIGNED
{% for header in spec.global.headers %}
- {{ prefix | caseUpper }}_{{ header.key | caseUpper }}
{% endfor %}